  "notes": "Jacket shows '21' in back right corner\nRunouts are etched except \"IAM\" in triangle, which denotes a [l313252] pressing.\nFirst cat.nr. on cover and label, second on spine.\n\nOn labels:\nA1 presented as 'Who Do You Love (Part 1)'\nA6 presented as 'Who Do You Love (Part 2)'\n\nThis version has \"Who Do You Love Suite\" printed above the spindle hole. A very similar Scranton pressing [r15543115] has \"Who Do You Love Suite\" printed below the spindle hole.\n\n---------------------------------\nLive portions recorded at Fillmore East and West.\n\"Calvary\" recorded live at Golden State Recorders, San Francisco, Nov. 19, 1968.\n",
  "released_formatted": "03 Mar 1969",
